 Find some monster that is fairly wimpy and let it beat you up. When your
hit points drop to 0 you will return to human form (sans armor and weapon,
which is why to pick a wimpy monster) with your original hit points at
100%. The same goes for lycanthropy, but you have simply been polymorphed
by a trap in a one-shot deal.

 Or you can wait for quite a while, and eventually you will return to normal.
But it gets boring.


